  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 706.02 Approval Period. The commissioner shall approve an IDIP or WIDIP provider for a specific area of the state for a 2-year period beginning January 1, 2008, following the RFP process.\n\nSource. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
